WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.290
Midnight in a greenhouse.

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.830
The lights are off, the door
is shut, and nobody is here.

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.670
Hour by hour, the soil dries out
and the leaves begin to droop.

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.370
Then, with no one there, the
sprinklers hiss into life.

5
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.150
So what made that happen,
with no human in sight?

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.190
In this mission, you'll meet the
three parts of an automated system:

7
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.810
sensors, microprocessors and actuators.

8
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.790
You'll see how a sensor
measures a physical quantity,

9
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.990
such as moisture, and sends it on as data.

10
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.150
And you'll follow a control
loop that keeps going round,

11
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.710
day and night.

12
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:43.040
Your mission: work out what turns
the water on when nobody is there.
